cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SliceBench
message: "If you use SliceBench in your work, please cite the following."
type: software
abstract: >-
  SliceBench is a position-estimation benchmark for histological brain sections.
  Given an image of a slice, models predict its anterior-posterior coordinate
  in the matching brain atlas. The benchmark spans coronal, sagittal, and
  horizontal planes across mouse and rat using public Allen Institute, EBRAINS,
  Zenodo, and figshare data.
